    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "common_1190_select_01",
      "hash64": "A7671F76A16F3AA3",
      "text": "什么意思？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "common_1190_select_02",
      "hash64": "A7672076A16F3C56",
      "text": "你究竟是谁？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "common_1190_hakase_09a",
      "hash64": "9534D3A9016A16C9",
      "text": "博士以她自己的知识和记忆为基础\\n创造了一个人工智能，也就是ＡＩ……\\r\\n而我则是由那个ＡＩ所驱动的机器人。[VAR 0x0114(000B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
