    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "common_1190_hakase_12a",
      "hash64": "8DF7BAA8FDB85081",
      "text": "博士如果知道自己挺身保护的故勒顿\\n活得好好的，应该也会感到很欣慰吧。[VAR 0x0114(000C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
